WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.841
Reflection is structured review, not vague rumination.

2
00:00:02.841 --> 00:00:12.584
It asks what happened, why it happened, what was assumed, what evidence was used, what changed, and what should be done differently next time.

3
00:00:12.584 --> 00:00:15.019
Reflection turns experience into reusable learning.

4
00:00:15.019 --> 00:00:21.108
Without it, people may repeat events without extracting the pattern that would improve future performance.

5
00:00:21.108 --> 00:00:25.167
Self-explanation is one of the most practical reflection tools.

6
00:00:25.167 --> 00:00:33.285
Instead of only naming the answer, explain why the answer works, why a step matters, or why an error happened.

7
00:00:33.285 --> 00:00:39.780
In technical work, this might mean explaining why one root cause is more likely than another.

8
00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:45.057
In writing, it might mean explaining why a section supports the main claim.

9
00:00:45.057 --> 00:00:49.522
In leadership, it might mean explaining why a message created confusion.

10
00:00:49.522 --> 00:00:51.958
Comparing predictions to outcomes strengthens reflection.

11
00:00:51.958 --> 00:00:57.235
Before acting, make a prediction: what do I expect to happen, and why?

12
00:00:57.235 --> 00:00:58.858
Afterward, compare the result.

13
00:00:58.858 --> 00:01:04.541
If the outcome matched, ask whether the reasoning was actually sound or merely lucky.

14
00:01:04.541 --> 00:01:08.195
If it did not match, ask which assumption failed.

15
00:01:08.195 --> 00:01:12.254
This habit improves judgment because it connects thinking to evidence.

16
00:01:12.254 --> 00:01:17.531
Personal after-action reviews, learning journals, and decision notes can make reflection easier.

17
00:01:17.531 --> 00:01:20.372
They do not need to be elaborate.

18
00:01:20.372 --> 00:01:26.055
Record the goal, the approach, the uncertainty, the result, the feedback, and the adjustment.

19
00:01:26.055 --> 00:01:30.114
Over time, those notes reveal recurring gaps and useful patterns.

20
00:01:30.114 --> 00:01:36.609
Reflection becomes less about criticizing yourself and more about building a memory system for better work.
